    31	  the file the rename replaces to the file that was read (see below). A file
    32	  holds nothing to claim when `commands` is exactly `[]` and it carries a
    33	  `variables` map, or carries no `variables` while the far side holds none.
    34	  Such a file is left untouched: nothing is written, and its `variables` map
