    35	the next one." (lines 76–77) with:
    36	
    37	> - A batch is claimed at the window's next read. **Known residual (vehicle #39):** a file replaced
    38	>   between the vehicle's read and its rewrite of an earlier one can be lost without a result. A
    39	>   take that cannot lose it is planned. Until it lands, write a new batch only after the previous
    40	>   one has been claimed.
